Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.component.names|Asset Publisher,Web Content Administration|
		|testray.main.component.name|Asset Publisher|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And Page add
		|pageName|Asset Publisher Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Asset Publisher Page|
	Then Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Asset Publisher|

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add Web Content PG Via AP
Priority: 4
	Given TestCase get Site Name
##########################################################
The Poshi return element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
		|siteName|${siteName}|
	When ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|${siteName}|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Asset Publisher Page|
	And WebContent add PG Via AP
		|webContentContent|WC WebContent Content|
		|webContentTitle|WC Webcontent Title|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Asset Publisher Page|
	Then WebContent view PG Via AP
		|webContentContent|WC WebContent Content|
		|webContentTitle|WC Webcontent Title|
Scenario: Add Web Content With Global Scope Via CP To Liferay AP
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|PGAssetpublisherWebcontent#AddWebContentWithGlobalScopeViaCPToLiferayAP|
	When ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Global|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Add CP
	And WebContent add CP
		|webContentContent|WC WebContent Content|
		|webContentTitle|WC WebContent Title|
	And PortletEntry publish
	And WebContent view Title
		|webContentTitle|WC WebContent Title|
	And Navigator open URL
	And Page add
		|pageName|Test Page 1|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Asset Publisher|
	And AssetPublisherPortlet configure Site Scope PG
		|siteName|Global|
		|siteScopeType|Global|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Test Page 1|
	And AssetPublisherPortlet configure Site Scope Remove Site PG
		|siteName|Liferay|
		|siteScopeType|Current Site|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Test Page 1|
	And AssetPublisherPortlet view Asset PG
		|assetContent|WC WebContent Content|
		|assetTitle|WC WebContent Title|
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Global|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Edit CP
		|webContentTitle|WC WebContent Title|
	And WebContent edit CP
		|webContentContentEdit|WC WebContent Content Edit|
		|webContentTitle|WC WebContent Title|
		|webContentTitleEdit|WC WebContent Title Edit|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Test Page 1|
	And AssetPublisherPortlet view Asset PG
		|assetContent|WC WebContent Content Edit|
		|assetTitle|WC WebContent Title Edit|
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Global|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContent delete CP
		|siteScopeName|Global|
		|webContentTitle|WC WebContent Title Edit|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Test Page 1|
	And AssetPublisherPortlet view Asset Not Present PG
		|assetContent|WC WebContent Content|
		|assetTitle|WC WebContent Title|
	And AssetPublisherPortlet view Asset Not Present PG
		|assetContent|WC WebContent Content Edit|
		|assetTitle|WC WebContent Title Edit|
	Then AssetPublisherPortlet view Read More Link Not Present PG
