Scenario: Add Web Content With Structure And Global Scope Via CP To Liferay AP
Priority: 3
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|PGAssetpublisherWebcontent#AddWebContentWithStructureAndGlobalScopeViaCPToLiferayAP|
