Scenario: Display Web Content Tag Via AP
Priority: 4
	Given Page add
		|pageName|Tags Navigation Page|
	When Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Tags Navigation Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Tags Navigation|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Tags Navigation Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Asset Publisher|
	And AssetPublisherPortlet configure Show Metadata Fields PG
		|addMetadata|true|
		|metadataFieldList|Tags|
		|portletName|Asset Publisher|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Tags|
	And Tag add CP
		|tagName|tag name|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto Add CP
	And WebContent add With Tag CP
		|tagNameList|tag name|
		|webContentContent|Web Content Content|
		|webContentTitle|Web Content Title|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Tags Navigation Page|
	And TagsNavigationPortlet view Default PG
		|tagNameList|tag name|
	Then AssetPublisherPortlet view PG
		|assetContent|Web Content Content|
		|assetTitle|Web Content Title|
		|tagName|tag name|
Scenario: Save As Draft Web Content PG Via AP
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Asset Publisher Page|
	When WebContent add Draft PG Via AP
		|webContentContent|WC WebContent Content|
		|webContentTitle|WC Webcontent Title|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentNavigator goto View Status
		|webContentStatus|Draft|
		|webContentTitle|WC Webcontent Title|
	Then WebContent view Status
		|webContentContent|WC WebContent Content|
		|webContentStatus|Draft|
		|webContentTitle|WC Webcontent Title|